<title>CANADA: TD-Bank /Waterhouse deal to close Oct. 15.</title>
<headline>TD-Bank /Waterhouse deal to close Oct. 15.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toronto-Dominion Bank said on Monday that its acquisition of U.S. discount broker Waterhouse Investor Services Inc was expected to close October 15.</p>
<p>Earlier today, the U.S. Federal Reserve approved the bank's application to acquire all voting shares in Waterhouse and its subsidiary bank.</p>
<p>Waterhouse shareholders will receive US$38 per Waterhouse share in either cash or TD-Bank common stock.</p>
<p>The share exchange ratio will be based on the average weighted price of TD-Bank's stock over 15 trading days from September 10 through September 30, the bank said.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
